sequence Checkout Across Twelve Services
// stress: wide-or-tall — twelve participants in one flow, so the diagram is far wider than a screen
Browser
Edge CDN
API Gateway
Auth Service
Cart Service
Pricing Service
Inventory Service
Payment Service
Fraud Check
Order Service
Notification Service
Data Warehouse

Browser -GET /checkout-> Edge CDN
Edge CDN -forward-> API Gateway
API Gateway -verify session-> Auth Service
Auth Service -session ok-> API Gateway
API Gateway -load cart-> Cart Service
Cart Service -price lines-> Pricing Service
Cart Service -check stock-> Inventory Service
Inventory Service -in stock-> Cart Service
Browser -pay-> API Gateway
API Gateway -charge-> Payment Service
Payment Service -score-> Fraud Check
Fraud Check -approved-> Payment Service
Payment Service -paid-> Order Service
Order Service -email receipt-> Notification Service
Order Service -emit event-> Data Warehouse
